# Shipped on purpose (listed here as documentation, do NOT ignore):
#   package.json   — required manifest
#   README.md      — Marketplace landing page
#   CHANGELOG.md   — Marketplace "Changelog" tab
#   LICENSE        — Marketplace "License" tab
#   images/**      — icon + README screenshots
#   themes/**      — the themes themselves
